  "description": "Alpha-Plumbing Services, LLC is a family-owned and operated plumbing company based in Goodyear, Arizona. With more than 25 years of hands-on experience, we provide dependable residential and light-commercial plumbing services throughout Goodyear and the West Valley. Our team handles everything from everyday plumbing repairs, drain cleaning, water-heater replacement, fixture repairs, and sewer issues to slab leaks, water-line replacement, whole-home repiping, gas-line installation, remodel plumbing, and new-construction plumbing. We are committed to honest communication, quality workmanship, and practical solutions that help customers protect their homes and businesses. Arizona ROC #345448.",
